[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3031455902","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108223#issuecomment-3031455902","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108223","id":3031455902,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60sFie","user":{"login":"bs-mwoerner","id":35597337,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk3MzM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35597337?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner","html_url":"https://github.com/bs-mwoerner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-03T08:57:48Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T08:57:48Z","body":"Looks like `TabContainer` uses a convention where the first tab added is automatically selected, setting `current_tab` to 0. Since -1 is the default value, it is not serialized and thus `current_tab` is never changed back to -1 even if that is what was set in the editor. If that's the case, then I suppose there's currently no way to persist a -1 value for the `current_tab` property of a `TabContainer` that has children...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3031455902/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3032342032","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108223#issuecomment-3032342032","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108223","id":3032342032,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60vd4Q","user":{"login":"thygrrr","id":8904620,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MDQ2MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8904620?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr","html_url":"https://github.com/thygrrr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-03T13:46:36Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T13:46:36Z","body":"The docs expressly state that -1 means no selection. It's also an important expected behaviour for me.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3032342032/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3032559454","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108223#issuecomment-3032559454","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108223","id":3032559454,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60wS9e","user":{"login":"bs-mwoerner","id":35597337,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk3MzM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35597337?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner","html_url":"https://github.com/bs-mwoerner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-03T14:50:45Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T14:50:45Z","body":"I wasn't contradicting you. This is clearly not working as intended. It's a good issue. 👍","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3032559454/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3033403671","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108223#issuecomment-3033403671","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108223","id":3033403671,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60zhEX","user":{"login":"CreatedBySeb","id":11736217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-03T19:38:20Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T19:38:20Z","body":"Confirmed on stable `v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]`. The `-1` is not being persisted, and even manually editing the file to add it does not allow it to be persisted. Attempting to set `current_tab` to `-1` does not work if `deselect_enabled` is `false`, so clearly there are checks that allow for `-1` in the case of deselection being enabled, it just isn't persisted which results in you not being able to start with no tab selected. Adding a script that trivially sets `current_tab = -1` in `_ready` provides a workaround, and achieves the desired behaviour.\n\n```\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - macOS Sequoia (15.5.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 (Apple7) - Apple M1 (8 threads)\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3033403671/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3033533960","html_url":"https://